            "body": "<p>Soft wool traps heat without the bulk of a puffer. The belted waist holds its shape, so you put it on once and forget about it from morning until evening. Choose your bundle, pick color and size for each piece, then add to cart.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features & Fabric",
            "body": "<p>Dense winter wool with a brushed lining that stays gentle on skin. A belted waist that sits flat without digging in. Holds its shape wear after wear instead of stretching out in a week. Pair it with denim, a dress, or under a longer coat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_3": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Size & Fit",
            "body": "<p>Sizes XS to XL, cut for a smaller waist over an easy sleeve. Use the Size Guide above to find your best fit. Between sizes? Size up for layering. And if the fit is off, the exchange is free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "body": "<p>Ships in 2 to 3 business days, fully tracked. You have 90 days to decide: if this is not the jacket you reach for every morning, a real person refunds you in full. Wrong size? The exchange is free, always.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_5": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
